#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All that's on it right now is the school crest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…人が死ぬところも見てるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone's using these cameras to watch people die...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as it gets on my nerves, I'd better leave it\n"
"alone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄格子の開閉スイッチだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the switch that raises and lowers the gate.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは鍵を持ってないから、開けられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have the key, so I can't activate it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に扉がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a hatch on the floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開かない…
#. 鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The door won't budge. It must be locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここはトラッシュルーム…つまりゴミ捨て場だな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the trash room. The dump, in other words.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、鉄格子がジャマで中に入れないか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But with the gate in the way, I can't actually get\n"
"inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
